# Testcase 16 — Performance / throughput
# Covers: REQ-11
#
# Uses the perf-tuned configs.  LogGenerator must drive this at a high EPS;
# use `logStatistics` on both ends to watch throughput.
#
# INTENTIONALLY NOT CHAIN-SAFE. This is a performance benchmark, not a
# correctness check — there's no single correct EPS value to assert
# pass/fail against, and Docker Desktop's virtualized networking layer
# doesn't produce numbers comparable to bare metal anyway. No
# LG_PRODUCER_CONFIG / AUTO_EXIT_SERVICE is set on purpose, so
# ./run-testcases.sh correctly SKIPs this one. Run it interactively with
# ./run-testcase.sh 16 — see TESTCASES.md's TC-16 section for the full
# rationale and the manual baseline/full-chain procedure.

TC_TITLE="Performance / throughput test"
TC_COVERS="11"
TC_PROFILES=""

UPSTREAM_A_CONFIG=/airgap/config/upstream-perf.properties
DOWNSTREAM_CONFIG=/airgap/config/downstream-perf.properties
